[gd_scene load_steps=3 format=3]

; FFT-style unit card: a portrait tile framed in the team colour, then the name in the display
; face with level and class, and the HP and AC lines over a wide HP bar. Used for the hovered or
; acting unit bottom left, and for the attacker and target on the enemy-turn band.

